        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akisicanet ŋina a ŋakan: Todyakakin ŋibaren",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Ekapolon neni a Moses, “Ape neni a Parao, tolimok atemar ŋakiro ŋuna irworo Ekapolon Akuj a Ŋiburaniyae ikes nu, kimyek ŋituŋa kaŋ toloto, ikotere ilipete neni kaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani pa kicamak iyoŋ ikes toloto, torubak iwounitor ikes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "itedyakakini Ekapolon anapedor keŋ ŋibaren kus: Ŋaŋolei, ŋisigirya, ŋikaala, ŋaatuk ka ŋamesekin ta ŋamee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai iwuakini Ekapolon atyakatait kidiŋ ŋibaren a Ŋisirael ka ŋulu a Ŋijipitian; ikotere nai nyetwana ibarasit idio alobaren a Ŋisirael.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totubu Ekapolon apaki tema, “Itiyakin ŋakiro ŋun moi taparacu nakwap na.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋina atupakini ŋin, abu Ekapolon kitiya ŋakiro ŋun; apotu ŋibaren a Ŋijipitian daadaŋ totwaka, nai mam ŋini a Ŋisirael ipei daŋ ŋini abu totwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiŋitiŋit Parao ŋituŋa ketwakito ŋibaren a Ŋisirael daŋ, nai abu toryamu atemar mam ipei daŋ alobaren a Ŋisirael kebu totwana. Kikote neni daŋ, abu Parao torubak itogogoŋit akou keŋ, abu nyecamak Ŋisirael toloto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akisicanet ŋina a ŋakanikapei: Ŋilepunoe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Ekapolon neni a Moses ka Aron, “Tolemutu etulya aneni epurikinit alokenoi, kiela Moses lokuwuam ite Parao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eruwor etulya ŋol apuwa anakwap a Ijipit a daadaŋ, ido eyauni apuwa ŋin ŋilepunoe ŋulu eruwor ŋabusyo ŋuna erutonorete ŋawat a ŋituŋa ka ŋuna a ŋibaren a akwap a Ijipit a daadaŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu Moses ka Aron tolemut etulya aneni apurikinit alokenoi, toloto towua alokiŋaren Parao, ido kiela Moses etulya lokuwuam, yau ŋilepunoe ŋulu apotu toruwor ŋabusyo ŋuna arutonorete ŋawat a ŋituŋa ka ŋuna a ŋibaren. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋikekukujak nyepedosi aponare neni ayai Moses, anerae ayakatar ikes ŋilepunoe, apotu ŋilepunoe kiteryamut ŋikekukujak kaapei ka ŋituŋa a Ijipit daadaŋ ŋican. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu Ekapolon kitogogoŋ akou a Parao, towou akiirar ŋakiro ata Moses lopite ŋolopei sek alimokinitor Ekapolon Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akisicanet ŋina a ŋakanikaarei: Agiro ka ŋakako",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Ekapolon neni a Moses, “Tonyou moi taparacu eriŋa ataparacu kitoodiyar neni a Parao, tolimok iŋes atemar ŋakiro ŋuna irworo Ekapolon Akuj a Ŋiburaniyae ikes nu: Kimyek ŋituŋa kaŋ toloto, ikotere ilipete neni kaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani pa kimyek, eyakuuni ayoŋ ŋakisicaneta kaŋ neni kon, neni a ŋikapolok a ŋulu ipukatotor iyoŋ ka neni a ŋituŋa kon, ikotere iyoŋ iyenuni atemar mam ice ikikwaan ka ayoŋ anakwap a daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kerae ekyaarite ayoŋ akan kaŋ akiar iyoŋ ka ŋituŋa kon a ŋidekesyo, kemam tokona iyes ŋini eyai nakwap kus na. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ŋakiro nu ikes pa akaarya ayoŋ iyoŋ: Erae aŋuna ka akisitiya iyoŋ etoodiunia apedor kaŋ ka ikotere kiseraere ekiro kaŋ anakwap a daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai eriŋa bo iyoŋ itopolooro imanit ŋituŋa kaŋ, ido nyicamit akimyekin ikes toloto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moi taparacu ŋisaae lupei lu, eyakuuni ayoŋ akiru ŋina a ŋakako ŋina alalan ŋina nyilima nakwap a Ijipit ŋinapei kesubere akwap ŋin tari tokona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun nai, kiyakiya ŋituŋa kiudakis ŋibaren ka ibore daadaŋ ŋini eyai kiŋa. Kiudakis nakiboisyo ŋuna epedoryata aiun. Ituŋanan, kori ibarasit daadaŋ ŋini eyai kiŋa nenilapat, ŋini nyiudakinitae kai, eari akiru ŋina a ŋakako erae keryamu ikes alokiŋa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋikapolok ŋulu epukatotor Parao ŋulu apotu ŋakiro ŋuna alimuni Ekapolon tonomosi toloto atipei kibunyakis ŋipi kec ka ŋibaren kec, kitolomasi nakiboisyo ŋuna epedoryata aiun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋikapolok ŋulu apotu nyemitakis ŋakiro a Ekapolon, apotu kimyekis ŋipi kec ka ŋibaren kec anenilapat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Ekapolon neni a Moses, “Kikyaa akan kon kidiama, ikotere akiru ŋina a ŋakako kilim nakwap a Ijipit daadaŋ, totep ŋituŋa ka ŋityaŋ ta ibore ŋini elomunit anakwap a Ijipit a daadaŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikyaa nai Moses akan keŋ kidiama, ido abu Ekapolon kiyaku akiru ŋina agiro toya ŋakako, kimilya akwap nooi. Iŋes atemar abu Ekapolon kiyaku akiru ŋina a ŋakako nakwap a Ijipit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilim akiru ŋina a ŋakako nen, torubak agiro ka akimilyaa irimirimi nen. Arae ŋin akiru ŋina alalan nooi anakwap a Ijipit ŋinapei kipukakinet iŋes bon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toara ŋakako ibore daadaŋ anakwap a Ijipit ŋini ayai nenilapat, ŋituŋa ka ŋityaŋ; toara ŋakako tari ibore daadaŋ ŋini alomunit anakwap a Ijipit, tobilibiliyasi ŋikito daadaŋ anariet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakibois a Gosen bon neni aya Ŋisirael, iŋes abu akiru ŋina a ŋakako ŋin nyilim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
